          "at": "2026-10-30T02:27:47.451Z",
          "html": "<p>Folded into this step: <code>columns</code> on the property editor or on a group (<code>&lt;ui-property-group columns=\"2\"&gt;</code>), the group's winning.  A compact editor starts at 2, any other at 1.  Still in P31's plan, waiting for your Accept.</p>"
